==English==

===Etymology===
From the testing of [[gold]] with [[nitric acid]] (true gold is not affected)

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|figuratively}} A [[rigorous]] test or [[appraisal]] of the [[quality]] or [[worth]] of something.
# {{lb|en|historical}} In the 1960s, a [[party]] based around the use and [[advocacy]] of the [[psychedelic]] [[drug]] [[LSD]] ("acid").

